  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "One region, three very different islands: one grew for centuries, one was resettled, one was planned and built. The rest of this chapter takes them one at a time, through the same topics in the same order."
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Sources"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "text": "MALÉ"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "The capital. Dense and organically grown, the centre of work and trade for the whole region."
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "text": "Before 1153"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "208.03"
  },
