   "text": "4.4 times the guide"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Guide: UN-Habitat recommends at least 150p/ha for a compact, walkable neighbourhood"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "text": "The hub: every route starts or ends here"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
